[Conflicting scopes]
├ Server "shadow" is defined in multiple scopes with different endpoints: user (/bin/echo stale), local (/bin/echo local). OAuth tokens are stored per endpoint, so authenticating in one context will not carry over.
└ Keep the correct endpoint and remove the others: `claude mcp remove shadow -s user` or `claude mcp remove shadow -s local`

